  "title": "Nimono Garlicky Thai Fish Kanom Jeen",
  "description": "A garlicky and crisp one-pot Thai dish featuring fish sauce and aekjeot, simmered in a nimono style and served with kanom jeen, this recipe is keto friendly and perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
